<title>USA: Celestial stake lifted by Gabelli group.</title>
<headline>Celestial stake lifted by Gabelli group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Thursday it raised its stake in Celestial Seasonings Inc to 444,600 common shares or 10.98 percent from 8.83 percent held Jan 27.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 32,400 common shares from Feb 21 to March 5 at $21.505 to $22.375 per share.</p>
<p>Celestial, based in Boulder, Colo., makes herbal and specialty black teas.</p>
</text>
